{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-11-22 17:46:00', 'title': 'JCP&L PREPARES SYSTEM, EQUIPMENT FOR WINTER WEATHER', 'text': 'HOLMDEL, N.J., NOV. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AHEAD OF THE COLD WINTER MONTHS, JERSEY CENTRAL POWER & LIGHT (JCP&L), A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), IS CONDUCTING INSPECTIONS AND COMPLETING EQUIPMENT MAINTENANCE ACROSS ITS 3,200-SQUARE-MILE SERVICE AREA TO ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY FOR CUSTOMERS WHILE THEY RELY ON POWER TO STAY SAFE AND COMFORTABLE.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-11-22 17:44:00', 'title': 'PENN POWER COMPLETES INSPECTIONS AND MAINTENANCE TO HELP ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY FOR CUSTOMERS THROUGH WINTER SEASON', 'text': 'NEW CASTLE, PA., NOV. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WITH THE COLD-WEATHER MONTHS EXPECTED TO PRODUCE HIGHER ELECTRIC USE, PENN POWER, A FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) ELECTRIC COMPANY,\xa0RECENTLY COMPLETED INSPECTIONS AND EQUIPMENT MAINTENANCE TO HELP ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY FOR CUSTOMERS WHILE THEY RELY ON POWER TO STAY WARM, SAFE AND COMFORTABLE.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-11-22 17:43:00', 'title': 'MET-ED COMPLETES INSPECTIONS AND MAINTENANCE TO ENHANCE ELECTRIC SERVICE RELIABILITY THROUGH WINTER SEASON', 'text': 'READING, PA., NOV. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WITH WINTER WEATHER ON THE HORIZON, MET-ED, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), IS COMPLETING EQUIPMENT INSPECTIONS AND MAINTENANCE TO HELP KEEP POWER FLOWING TO CUSTOMERS WHEN THEY NEED IT MOST TO STAY SAFE AND COMFORTABLE.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-11-22 17:42:00', 'title': 'WEST PENN POWER COMPLETES INSPECTIONS AND MAINTENANCE TO ENHANCE ELECTRIC SERVICE RELIABILITY THROUGH WINTER SEASON', 'text': 'GREENSBURG, PA., NOV. 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WITH WINTER WEATHER ON THE HORIZON, WEST PENN POWER, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), IS COMPLETING EQUIPMENT INSPECTIONS AND MAINTENANCE TO HELP KEEP POWER FLOWING TO CUSTOMERS WHEN THEY NEED IT MOST TO STAY SAFE AND COMFORTABLE.'}{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '